{"id":"662682","name":"湖北肉糕","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"","cover":"images/662682/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"梅头肉","amount":"450克"},{"name":"红薯粉","amount":"100克"},{"name":"鱼肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"葱姜水备好，鱼肉剁成茸，梅头肉剁碎。","img":"images/662682/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红薯粉加少量水溶解。","img":"images/662682/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将鱼茸放入溶解的红薯粉中搅拌均匀。","img":"images/662682/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再放入剁碎的梅头肉。","img":"images/662682/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加蛋清，盐，鸡精，胡椒粉。","img":"images/662682/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/662682/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"顺时针搅拌，多次加入葱姜水，搅拌上劲。","img":"images/662682/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将肉糊放入抹油的容器中，用勺子抹平。","img":"images/662682/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入蒸锅中蒸60分钟。","img":"images/662682/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"抹蛋黄液，再蒸五分钟。然后再抹一次，再蒸五分钟。","img":"images/662682/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/662682/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"冷却切片。","img":"images/662682/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"煮白菜，番茄都很好吃。","img":"images/662682/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}